        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The story"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "From Bangladesh to Dublin, and back to building things."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Khalid Farhan moved from Bangladesh to Ireland and spent years working in and around digital marketing, first as a freelancer, then building campaigns for clients across hospitality, professional services, e-commerce, and more."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The agency grew organically, no funding, no agency network, just results that made clients refer other clients. Over 12 years we have worked with 400+ businesses across Ireland, the UK, Bangladesh, and 10+ countries."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "What we believe"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "Our values."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Honesty over hype"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We don't promise results we can't deliver. Before every engagement, we tell you honestly what's achievable and in what timeframe."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Results or nothing"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Every piece of work we do is tied to a business outcome. Traffic is not a result. Revenue is a result."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Permanent education"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Marketing changes faster than any other industry. We invest heavily in staying ahead, and we share everything we learn."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Specificity wins"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Generic strategies produce generic results. Every client gets a strategy built for their specific business, market, and budget."
        }
      ]
    },
